A course usually covers all the issues discussed here in much more detail, usually in combination with practical experience.
A course is usually between 2 and 5 days long and includes role-playing games, a lot of first aid and sometimes weapons training.
There are numerous books and journals for survival in the wilderness, but only a few publications on war zones.
Travelers planning a gender-aligning operation abroad must make sure that they carry valid identification documents for the return journey.
The willingness of governments to issue passports with unspecified gender (X) or documents updated to the desired name and spend is different.
The willingness of foreign governments to recognize these documents is also very different.
