If you come home after a stay abroad, you have adapted to a different culture and some behaviors of your home culture.
When you first traveled abroad, people were probably patient and understanding because they knew that travelers would have to adapt in a new country.
It may not be expected that returning travellers will also be required for patience and understanding.
The sound and light show at the pyramids is one of the most interesting attractions for children in the area.
You can see the pyramids in the darkness and while it's silent before the show begins.
You usually hear the sounds of tourists and sellers. The history of sounds and lights is just like a storybook.
